{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52588","headline":"七夕 · 宋务光","name":"七夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牵牛遥映水，织女正当车。\n星桥通汉使，机石逐望近，经秋离别赊。\n秋将今夕恨，复看明年花。\n（见宋蒲积中《古今岁时杂咏》卷二五）（按：《古今岁时杂咏》误将务收入六朝。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋务光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52588.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52588","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}